{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Torsion.mass_decomposition_categorical","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Torsion.mass_decomposition_categorical","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.mass_decomposition_categorical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.mass_decomposition_categorical","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/mass_decomposition_categorical.lean#L37-L53","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\nLet $(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)$ be a\n([quantum observable universe](#def\\:quantum-observable-universe)); let $q$\ndenote the substrate parameter.  Let\n$\\varrho \\colon \\mathbf{1} \\to A$ be a morphism (a \"closed cycle\" in $A$,\n[mass identity](#def\\:mass-identity)) whose categorical support is\ngenerated by $N$ consecutive extensions along the brane tower\n$\\{A_n\\}_{n \\geq 0}$\n([recursive brane tower](#def\\:recursive-brane-tower)), applied to a\nbase-level morphism $\\varrho_0 \\colon \\mathbf{1} \\to A_0$.\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim over a context class and discharges it from the class's fields (§3b-conditional). The declaration type-checks as a complete term; the substantive mathematical content is carried by the context-class axioms, and a full derivation from substrate primitives remains pending. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:thm:topological-mass","label":"thm:topological-mass","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/topological-mass.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.impl_mass_decomposition_categorical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.impl_mass_decomposition_categorical","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/mass_decomposition_categorical.lean#L33-L33","doc":"Manuscript identity: tower decomposition\n`𝔪(ρ) = Σ_{n=0..N-1} 𝔪_n(ρ_n)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.decomposition_active","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.decomposition_active","kind":"theorem","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/mass_decomposition_categorical.lean#L30-L30","doc":"Hypothesis that the mass decomposition is active. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.mass_decomposes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.mass_decomposes","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/mass_decomposition_categorical.lean#L28-L28","doc":"Proposition: the mass decomposes categorially. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.mass_level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.mass_level","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/mass_decomposition_categorical.lean#L26-L26","doc":"Per-level mass contribution `𝔪_n(ρ_n)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.mass","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/mass_decomposition_categorical.lean#L24-L24","doc":"Total categorical mass `𝔪(ρ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.N","kind":"def","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/mass_decomposition_categorical.lean#L22-L22","doc":"The brane-tower depth `N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.q","kind":"def","line":20,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/mass_decomposition_categorical.lean#L20-L20","doc":"The substrate parameter `q : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/mass_decomposition_categorical.lean#L18-L18","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassDecompositionCategoricalContext","kind":"class","line":15,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/mass_decomposition_categorical.lean#L15-L35","doc":"Abstract context for the `mass_decomposition_categorical` claim — manuscript-named\ntyped fields below; the `holds` field carries the `Prop`-valued\nclaim of the lemma. ","signatureChunk":0}]}